<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Phamis downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Phamis downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc analyst Satish Tyagi downgraded Phamis Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>- Phamis warned of lower-than-expected fourth quarter results on Friday.</p>
<p>- Shares were up 1-1/16 to 14-5/8 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
